# Output folder

Every file this plugin creates goes in `adrenaline/chronology/` at the project root.

If `.cursor/adrenaline.json` exists and `outputDirs["plugin-chronology"]` holds a path, use that path. The path is relative to the project root, with no `..` and not absolute. If it is not valid, use `adrenaline/chronology/`.

If `adrenaline/chronology/` does not exist yet and `chronology/` at the project root already has this plugin's `ORIGIN.json` or `STATUS.md`, keep writing there.

Create the folder if it does not exist. Do not write anywhere else. In Cursor the hook creates it. The agent does not edit these files, and the reply does not name the folder.

`ORIGIN.json` and `STATUS.md` stay at that folder's root. One chat window is one file in `<person>/`. `<person>` is `git config user.name` in kebab-case: lowercase, accents folded (á to a, ñ to n), spaces to hyphens, other characters dropped. `<NNN>` is the next free number in that person's folder, not in the whole output folder. The `archivo` cell is `<person>/<file>`. The same `N` may appear for two people. The window id is the HTML comment `<!-- window:<id> -->` inside the file. This exception is the 2026-11-07 amendment of `adrenaline/software-architect/008-adr-asunto-subcarpeta.md`.

Write the paragraph in the language of the request. If the request names a language, use that one. Otherwise use the language the request is written in. Keep names the person already used. The type in the file name stays `chronology`. `STATUS.md` columns stay `N`, `archivo`, `estado`, `sustituye`, `notas`. The labels `Outcome:` and `Closed:`, and the window comment, stay in English.

Keep `ORIGIN.json` in that folder, beside `STATUS.md`. The fields are `suite` `ADRenaline-Suite`, `plugin` `plugin-chronology`, `repository` `https://github.com/ADRenaline-Suite/plugin-chronology`, and `convention` `adr-001`. It is not an `<NNN>` file and it has no row in `STATUS.md`. Write it when the folder is created, and again only if it is missing or a field differs. The marker names the folder. It does not say that each file inside is unchanged.
